        "text_nNaYeE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>01</em>| THE NAME</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_HrrWxD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Shunya is not nothing.<br/>Shunya is everything<br/>before it becomes something.</strong></p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-custom",
            "text_max_size": 38,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "basic-underline"
          }
        },
        "text_mkUMdV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>शून्य</em> — <em>śūnya</em> — is the Sanskrit word for <em>zero</em>. In the original language it carries far more weight than a numeral. It means <em>void</em>. Emptiness. The open space from which all things emerge.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 38,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_WcUPpJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The point before creation. The breath before the word. The silence that holds the sound. We took the name because it describes a method, not a mood: begin from nothing on purpose, and let everything that follows have a reason to exist.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 38,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "button_xcANE6": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "OnRepeat",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_size": "sm",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": false
          }
        },
        "text_khXbRy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The simplified transliteration. It lives in our domain and our <em>URLs.</em></p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 16,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "button_wmUMYW": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Shunya",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_size": "sm",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": false
          }
        },
        "text_XzWN6j": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Phonetically accurate <em>— श</em> is a palatal sibilant, closer to the spoken Sanskrit.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 16,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "button_HynAdH": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "SUन्य",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_size": "sm",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": false
          }
        },
        "text_Ca38np": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our mark. Latin and Devanagari inside <em>one</em> word.</p><p></p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 16,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "text",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
