            "subheading": "628 CE",
            "heading": "",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p><strong>Brahmagupta </strong>writes the <em>Brāhmasphuṭasiddhānta</em>— the first text to give zero its own arithmetic. Not a placeholder in a column. A number you could add, subtract, multiply.</p>",
